# DP book rails — Gov Hub source of truth

The files `desirableproperties-book/content/local/dp1.md` … `dp23.md` are **synced from Gov Hub**.
Do not edit them directly in this repo.

## Correct workflow

1. Edit the chapter on Gov Hub and get the revision approved.
2. Run `python3 scripts/govhub_sync_rails_from_hub.py` (use `--dry-run` first).
3. Commit with `[rail-sync]` in the message.

See `docs/GOVHUB-RAIL-SYNC.md` and `desirableproperties-book/content/local/README.md`.

## Publishing the other direction

`scripts/govhub_publish_dp_revisions.py` pushes local rails **to** Gov Hub. That is the legacy
direction; prefer Gov Hub → sync for ongoing editorial work on the DP book.

## Overrides

- `ALLOW_RAIL_EDIT=1` — allow a one-off local commit without `[rail-sync]`
- PR label `rail-sync` — CI accepts rail diffs
